s=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/da4aeef6a1c0f0e1726e7ebd2cbb2752.mp4?t=1786458620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout down to the last detail for any mission and engagement. With over 80 weapons, customizable loadouts with short- and long-distance attachments, and a plethora of clothing and equipment to choose from, Arma 3 opens up a world of tactical opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/5acc237a12a38081106e9f579141f26a.avif?t=1786458620\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/48480fdef18a2b6aa2290656aa178c32.poster.avif?t=1786458620\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/48480fdef18a2b6aa2290656aa178c32.webm?t=1786458620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/48480fdef18a2b6aa2290656aa178c32.mp4?t=1786458620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head into combat on foot, drive various types of light and heavy armor, operate autonomous vehicles, or take to the skies in helicopters and jets. Conduct combined arms operations over air, land, and sea, with over 40 intricately modeled and accurately simulated vehicles to drive and pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/12e3344777cfab902e6a3d8acef12527.avif?t=1786458620\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/479bf9a9972d9380ac3e01e2b336f255.poster.avif?t=1786458620\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/479bf9a9972d9380ac3e01e2b336f255.webm?t=1786458620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/479bf9a9972d9380ac3e01e2b336f255.mp4?t=1786458620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master combined arms warfare across the sun-scorched Mediterranean islands of Altis, Stratis, and Malden, navigate the dense, hostile jungles of the South Pacific in Tanoa, and survive the militarized temperate woodlands of Livonia. Arma 3 features massive terrains totaling over 610 km² of open-world terrain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/1310a59f2530810dac5c36a7642db0ed.avif?t=1786458620\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/882ddf5a15368b745726dda92ad507a1.poster.avif?t=1786458620\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/882ddf5a15368b745726dda92ad507a1.webm?t=1786458620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/882ddf5a15368b745726dda92ad507a1.mp4?t=1786458620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over 160,000 user-generated items available for download on the Steam Workshop, ranging from custom weapons and vehicles to intense singleplayer scenarios and entirely new multiplayer game modes. Create your own intricate and immersive scenarios with Arma 3's comprehensive and intuitive Eden editor, and share your content with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/18c702db59bc43a51e5e13b53c6486c5.avif?t=1786458620\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/801902da156afcddbd90e55269defe9e.poster.avif?t=1786458620\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/801902da156afcddbd90e55269defe9e.webm?t=1786458620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/extras/801902da156afcddbd90e55269defe9e.mp4?t=1786458620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arma 3 can be enhanced with a vast library of DLC that adds new assets, capabilities, and transports you to entirely new theaters of war. Additional weapons, tanks, jets, helicopters, and more are available for purchase as official DLC and Creator DLC (CDLC) to expand and customize your Arma 3 experience. Expansive terrains transport you to the treacherous jungles of Vietnam, the fields and forests of Cold War Germany, and to the sun-scorched desert of the Sahara, and more, giving you thousands of additional hours of playtime. For those who want all available official content from the get-go, Arma 3 Platinum includes the base game and every official expansion and DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Experience true combat gameplay in a massive military sandbox. Deploy with a wide variety of single- and multiplayer content, a massive arsenal of modern weapons and vehicles, and limitless opportunities for content creation. Authentic, diverse, open - Arma 3 sends you to war.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Ukrainian, Slovak<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A significant step forward for the king of military simulation... Arma 3 is an unparalleled war story generator.”<br>84/100 – PC Gamer<br><br>“Arma 3 ambition in re-creating so many elements of modern warfare will astound you.”<br>8/10 – GameSpot<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/header.jpg?t=1786458620", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786458620", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/107410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786458620", "website": "https://www.arma3.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum: </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS: </strong>Windows 10 (64-bit)<br>\t</li><li><strong>Processor: </strong>Intel Core quad-core or AMD Athlon quad-core<br>\t</li><li><strong>Memory: </strong>8 GB RAM<br>\t</li><li><strong>Graphics: </strong>NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 or AMD Radeon HD 7850 or Intel HD Graphics 4000, with 1 GB video memory<br>\t</li><li><strong>DirectX®: </strong>10<br>\t</li><li><strong>Storage: </strong>50 GB available space<br>\t</li><li><strong>Audio: </strong>DirectX® compatible<br>        </li><li><strong>Other: </strong>Internet connection and free Steam account to activate <br>Dual Layer compatible when installing from DVD </li></ul>", "rec